<hi rendition="#c">F. <hi rendition="#g">Jones u. Co.,</hi> 31<hi rendition="#sup"><hi rendition="#aq">bi&amp;&#x017F;r </hi></hi> Faubourg Montmartre in Paris.</hi></p></div><lb/>
